---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/region';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Base
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE.shortName}`}
  description="Base Impact collects only the information you voluntarily provide. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed dark:text-slate-300">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        Base Impact Inc. collects only the information you voluntarily provide through our contact
        and feedback forms — typically your name, email address, and the message you send. We do
        not use tracking cookies, analytics scripts, or advertising pixels.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information solely to respond to your message. We do not sell, rent, or share
        your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Data storage</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are sent directly to our email inbox. We do not maintain a separate
        customer database or CRM. Messages are retained only as long as needed to complete the
        requested response.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        This site loads fonts from Google Fonts and uses Cloudflare for hosting and security. Those
        services may collect standard server logs (IP address, browser type, timestamps) as part of
        their normal operations. We do not control their data practices.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Donations</h2>
      <p>
        Donations are processed by <strong>Zeffy</strong>, a third-party payment processor. Zeffy
        handles all payment information on their secure servers. Base Impact does not see or store
        your payment card information. Donor names and contact details are used solely to send
        receipts and acknowledgments. We never sell, rent, or share donor information with third
        parties for marketing purposes.
      </p>
      <p>
        Zeffy's own privacy policy governs how they process payment information. You can review it
        at <a href="https://www.zeffy.com/en/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline">zeffy.com/en/legal/privacy-policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13. If you believe a child has
        provided us with personal information, contact us and we will remove it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can request that we delete any information you have submitted by emailing{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-semibold text-emerald-800 underline dark:text-emerald-400">{SITE.email}</a>.
        We will comply within a reasonable timeframe.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy as our organization grows. Changes will be posted on this page
        with an updated date.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy:{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-semibold text-emerald-800 underline dark:text-emerald-400">{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
